ion': ['A technique used to provide more task-related materials for teacher-student learning during the task-specific distillation stage.', 'A method used to extend the task-specific training set, involving word-level replacement using BERT and GloVe embeddings.', 'A method explained in the text.', 'A key procedure in the two-stage TinyBERT learning framework.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 3, 4, 5]}, 'Task-Specific Dataset': {'description': ['A dataset specific to a particular NLP task, used for fine-tuning BERT.', 'Datasets used for fine-tuning TinyBERT in the task-specific distillation stage. These datasets are augmented task-specific datasets.'], 'type': ['dataset'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 3]}, 'NLP Tasks': {'description': ['The specific Natural Language Processing tasks that TinyBERT is designed to improve, such as text classification, question answering, or other downstream tasks.', "The domain where TinyBERT's performance is evaluated, including various natural language understanding tasks."], 'type': ['task'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 3]}, 'Embedding-layer distillation': {'description': ["A specific technique used in the Transformer distillation process, focusing on transferring knowledge from the teacher model's embedding layer to the student model.", 'A distillation technique focused on transferring knowledge from the embedding layer of the teacher model to the student model.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'Prediction-layer distillation': {'description': ["A specific technique used in the Transformer distillation process, focusing on transferring knowledge from the teacher model's prediction layer to the student model.", 'A distillation technique applied to the prediction layer of the model.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [2, 6]}, 'Transformer Layer Distillation': {'description': ['A specific distillation technique applied to Transformer-based models, where knowledge is transferred from a teacher Tran