s. ; The initial stage where BERT is trained on a large unsupervised text corpus. ; The initial training phase of a model.\n', 'Name:NATURAL LANGUAGE PROCESSING (NLP)\nDescription:A field of computer science and artificial intelligence concerned with the interactions between computers and human language.\n']split_entities: text_tokens=4022, instructions_tokens=500, budget_for_entities=5478, number_of_entities=110, avg_entity_tokens=41, max_entities=133, num_groups=1, entities_per_group=[110]
